No firmware in this repository
------------------------------
This repository contains NO Pioneer DJ / AlphaTheta software, firmware, keys,
fonts, artwork or screenshots. The emulator boots the system that each developer
copies from their OWN XDJ-AZ (tools/az-emu-pull). That copy stays on the
developer's computer: build/ is ignored by git and no tool here uploads it.

